          "claim": "The profile has finite support by the assumption on $S$. Its weights satisfy $2\\sum_jw_{\\varepsilon,j}^2=1$, so $\\sum_jw_{\\varepsilon,j}^2=1/2$. Under a parameter $\\eta$, write $\\mu_j=\\eta_j/\\varepsilon$; then $Y_j/\\varepsilon=\\xi_j+\\mu_j$. Independence and [F4] give $$m_\\eta:=\\mathbb E_\\eta T_\\varepsilon=\\sum_jw_{\\varepsilon,j}\\mu_j^2,\\qquad \\operatorname{Var}_\\eta(T_\\varepsilon)=1+4\\sum_jw_{\\varepsilon,j}^2\\mu_j^2\\le1+4w_{\\varepsilon,0}m_\\eta.$$ In particular, under the null the statistic has mean zero and variance one.",
