          "claim": "Put $w=z^2$. The hyperbolic series give $$w\\sinh w-q(\\cosh w-1)=\\sum_{k\\ge1}\\frac{(2k-q)w^{2k}}{(2k)!}.$$ Every coefficient is positive because $q<2$. Replacing $q$ by $2$ makes only the first coefficient zero and leaves every later coefficient positive. The positive denominators in $a,b$ therefore prove $a(z),b(z)>0$.",
