          "source": "lem-piccirillo-diagram-produces-dualizable-handle-link",
          "source_section": "Statement",
          "quote": "Assume the Axiom of Choice. There exists a dualizable framed handle link $(B,G,R)$ whose associated\nhandlebody is diffeomorphic to both zero-traces $X_0(C)$ and $X_0(K_P)$, with\nthe component orientations and zero-framings compatible with the diagrams\ndefining $C$ and $K_P$.",
