        {
          "fact": "F1",
          "source": "lem-conway-knot-alexander-polynomial-one",
          "source_section": "Statement",
          "quote": "Assume the Axiom of Choice. Let $\\Delta_C^\\#(t)$ be the unique unit associate\nof the knot Alexander generator that is symmetric under $t\\mapsto t^{-1}$\nand has $\\Delta_C^\\#(1)=1$. Then\n$$\\Delta_C^\\#(t)=1.$$",
