        },
        {
          "fact": "F3",
          "source": "lem-disconnected-projection-components-separated-by-jordan-curve",
          "source_section": "Statement",
          "quote": "Let $P\\subset S^2$ be the finite projection graph of a regular link diagram. If $P$ is disconnected, there is a simple closed curve $\\gamma\\subset S^2\\setminus P$ such that $P$ has points on both sides of $\\gamma$.",
