          "source": "lem-connected-regular-link-diagram-has-checkerboard-coloring",
          "source_section": "Statement",
          "quote": "Let $P\\subset S^2$ be the finite connected 4-valent graph underlying a regular link projection. Its complementary regions have exactly two colorings with two colors such that regions sharing an edge have different colors.",
