      "derivations": [
        {
          "id": "step-1-1",
          "claim": "The alpha-gamma diagram, and the diagram with those two attaching curves reversed, each have one intersection in each Spin$^c$ structure. Their infinity differentials are zero: the Maslov index of a self-disk in a torsion Spin$^c$ structure is $2n_z$, so cannot be one. The minus lattice in each summand is therefore exactly $U\\mathbb F_2[U][x_i,0]$, and its plus image has bottom $[x_i,0]$. Its correction term is the absolute grading of that generator, with no unknown exponent shift.",
