          "source": "thm-excision-for-singular-cohomology",
          "source_section": "Statement",
          "quote": "If $Z\\subseteq A\\subseteq X$ and $\\overline Z\\subseteq\\operatorname{int}_X A$, inclusion induces an isomorphism\n$$H^n(X,A;G)\\xrightarrow{\\sim}H^n(X\\setminus Z,A\\setminus Z;G)$$\nfor every integer $n$ and every abelian coefficient group $G$.",
