          "id": "step-1-1",
          "step": "1.1",
          "claim": "Choose an integral basis of $L$ and let $B$ be the integer $n\\times n$ matrix whose columns are the images of that basis under $f$. Since $f$ is isometric, the Gram matrix of $L$ is $B^{\\mathsf T}B$.",
          "inputs": [
