          "source_section": "Example",
          "quote": "For $R>0$, the sphere $S_R^{m-1}=\\{x\\in\\mathbb R^m:\\|x\\|_2=R\\}$ is the regular level $F^{-1}(R^2)$ of $F(x)=\\|x\\|_2^2$. At $x\\in S_R^{m-1}$,\n$$T_xS_R^{m-1}=x^\\perp=\\{h:\\langle x,h\\rangle=0\\}.$$",
          "uses": [
