          "source_section": "Statement",
          "quote": "For $A\\subseteq X$ there is an exact sequence\n$$\\cdots\\to H_n(A;G)\\to H_n(X;G)\\to H_n(X,A;G)\\xrightarrow{\\delta}H_{n-1}(A;G)\\to H_{n-1}(X;G)\\to\\cdots.$$",
