          "source": "thm-morse-sard-for-euclidean-maps",
          "source_section": "Statement",
          "quote": "Let $m\\ge0$, $n\\ge1$, and $r\\ge1$ be integers, let $U\\subseteq\\mathbb R^m$\nbe open, and let $f:U\\to\\mathbb R^n$ be a $C^r$ map with\n\n$$ r>\\max\\{m-n,0\\}. $$\n\nThen the critical value set of $f$ is a null subset of $\\mathbb R^n$.",
