          "quote": "Let $B$ be either a pair of pants or a once-punctured Möbius band, and let $p:N\\to B$ be a circle bundle whose total space is orientable. For each boundary torus $T$ of $N$, the inclusion $T\\hookrightarrow N$ induces an injective homomorphism $\\pi_1(T)\\to\\pi_1(N)$.",
