          "id": "step-3-1",
          "claim": "Suppose a finite accumulated family is incompressible in $E_K$. By [F5] its cut pieces inject into $E_K$ and are irreducible. A new torus chosen in $C$ injects into $C$ by [F6], and then into $E_K$ by composition. It is therefore incompressible in $E_K$ by [F6]. The empty family starts this induction. Thus every finite stage consists of incompressible tori in the original exterior and has irreducible cut pieces, and all applications of [F4]–[F5] are within their smooth categories.",
          "step": "3.1",
          "inputs": [
