          "source_section": "Statement",
          "quote": "Assume the Axiom of Countable Choice $\\mathrm{AC}_\\omega$ ([[def-countable-choice]]). Let $f:M\\to N$ be smooth and let $Z\\subseteq N$ be a closed embedded\nsubmanifold. Then $f$ is smoothly homotopic to a smooth map $g:M\\to N$ with\n$g\\pitchfork Z$.",
