          "source_section": "Statement",
          "quote": "Assume the hypotheses and conventions of the Levine–Tristram form definition. At every root $\\omega_0\\in S^1\\setminus\\{1\\}$ of $\\Delta_K$, each one-sided limit of the nonroot signature as the parameter moves along the unit circle to $\\omega_0$ exists and is an integer.",
