          "source_section": "Statement",
          "quote": "Assume the full Axiom of Choice. Let $g\\geq0$ and let $V\\in M_{2g}(\\mathbb Z)$ satisfy $\\det(V-V^T)=\\pm1$, where the empty skew matrix has determinant $1$. There is a connected compact smooth oriented surface $F\\subset S^3$ with one boundary component and an ordered integral basis of $H_1(F;\\mathbb Z)$ whose positive-push Seifert matrix is exactly $V$.",
