          "id": "step-1.1",
          "claim": "The raw zero-crossing complex of $U$ is $\\mathcal A$ in cohomological degree $0$ with zero differential by [F3]. Its generators $1,X$ have quantum degrees $1,-1$ by [F1], so its chain Euler polynomial is $q+q^{-1}$.",
