          "source_section": "Statement",
          "quote": "Assume the Axiom of Countable Choice. Every smooth oriented knot $K$ in the standard oriented three-sphere has its connected sum with its reverse mirror represented by the boundary of a smooth immersed disk in $S^3$ whose only multiple points are finitely many transverse double arcs, each having one proper preimage arc and one interior preimage arc. Consequently $K\\#K^\\dagger$ is ribbon in the ribbon-immersion sense.",
