          "fact": "F4",
          "source": "lem-levine-tristram-hermitian-form-singular-set",
          "source_section": "Statement",
          "quote": "Assume full AC. Let $K$ be a smooth oriented knot, let $F$ be any connected compact smooth oriented spanning surface of genus $g$, let $V$ be its positive-push Seifert matrix, and let $\\omega\\in S^1\\setminus\\{1\\}$. The Hermitian matrix\n$$H_\\omega=(1-\\omega)V+(1-\\bar\\omega)V^T$$\nis singular if and only if the normalized knot Alexander polynomial $\\Delta_K$ vanishes at $\\omega$.",
