          "claim": "For every nonzero $v\\in\\mathbb R^m$, $v^TSv=(A^Tv)^TC(A^Tv)+v^T\\Gamma v>0$ because $C\\succeq0$ and $\\Gamma\\succ0$. Thus $S\\succ0$ and both observation covariances have positive determinants. The same conclusion is recorded in [F2].",
