          "id": "derive-1.1",
          "claim": "By [F2], inclusion of the compact exterior into the open complement induces an isomorphism on fundamental groups and identifies the positive meridian classes. The total-linking homomorphism in [F3] therefore corresponds to $\\phi$; by [F4], $A_K$ is isomorphic to $N^{\\mathrm{ab}}$ with the action induced by conjugation by a positive meridian, up to replacing that action by its inverse according to the left-versus-right lift convention.",
