          "source_section": "Statement",
          "quote": "Assume the Axiom of Choice. Let $K$ be a smooth oriented knot, let $X_K=S^3\\setminus K$, and let $q\\ge2$. Let $A_K=H_1(\\widetilde X_K;\\mathbb Z)$ be the one-variable Alexander module with the positive-meridian deck action $t$. Then, as abelian groups,\n$$\nH_1(\\Sigma_q(K);\\mathbb Z)\\cong A_K/(t^q-1)A_K.\n$$",
