          "id": "derive-1.1",
          "claim": "By [F1], the double-cover homology is presented by the square integer matrix $V+V^T=V-(-1)V^T$. Its determinant is $D(-1)$. By [F2], the homology is finite exactly when $D(-1)\\ne0$, and then its order is $|D(-1)|$. The hypothesis needed by [F1] is the Axiom of Choice in [A1].",
