          "id": "derive-1.1",
          "claim": "For the trefoil, $V_T+V_T^T=\\begin{pmatrix}-2&1\\\\1&-2\\end{pmatrix}$. Swap its columns, add twice the first row to the second, then add twice the first column to the second; the result is $\\operatorname{diag}(1,-3)$. Each operation is unimodular, so [F1]–[F2] give $H_1(\\Sigma_2(T))\\cong\\mathbb Z/3\\mathbb Z$.",
