          "source": "thm-knot-cyclic-cover-order-from-alexander-polynomial",
          "source_section": "Statement",
          "quote": "Assume the Axiom of Choice. Let $K$ be a smooth oriented knot and let $q\\ge2$. If $\\zeta_q$ is any primitive $q$-th root of unity, then $H_1(\\Sigma_q(K);\\mathbb Z)$ is finite exactly when $\\Delta_K(\\zeta_q^j)\\ne0$ for every $1\\le j<q$, and in that case\n$$\n|H_1(\\Sigma_q(K);\\mathbb Z)|=\\prod_{j=1}^{q-1}|\\Delta_K(\\zeta_q^j)|.\n$$",
          "uses": [
