          "source_section": "Statement",
          "quote": "Every regular ideal tetrahedron in hyperbolic three-space has volume\n$$v_3=3\\Lambda(\\pi/3) =\\frac{3\\sqrt3}{4}\\sum_{k=0}^{\\infty} \\left(\\frac1{(3k+1)^2}-\\frac1{(3k+2)^2}\\right).$$",
