          "id": "step-1.2",
          "claim": "An ambient isotopy from $L$ to $L'$ restricts to an orientation-preserving diffeomorphism of their complements and carries each meridian class to a meridian class. It therefore carries $\\ker\\epsilon_L$ to $\\ker\\epsilon_{L'}$.",
