          "claim": "Here is the complete finite algebra to which the external Floer map computation in step2.1 is applied. Order the unmarked circles of a based $k$-circle state, and assign to them generators $x_c$. The reduced state space is $\\Lambda_{\\mathbb F_2}\\langle x_c\\rangle$: the basis monomial on a subset labels those circles by $X$, the others by $1$, and the marked circle by the quotient label $1$. Exterior multiplication is commutative over $\\mathbb F_2$ and each $x_c^2=0$. Thus this state space has dimension $2^{k-1}$, once an actual Floer vertex identification with it is supplied. This is a computation of the required state algebra, not yet of $\\widehat{HF}$.",
