          "fact": "F5",
          "source": "lem-temperley-lieb-generators-satisfy-local-relations",
          "source_section": "Statement",
          "quote": "Fix $n\\ge0$, a commutative ring $R$, and $\\delta\\in R$. For $1\\le i<n$, let $d_i\\in\\mathrm{TL}_n(R,\\delta)$ be the elementary cup-cap diagram of [[def-temperley-lieb-diagram-category]]. Then\n\n$$d_i^2=\\delta d_i\\ (1\\le i<n),\\qquad d_i d_{i+1}d_i=d_i,\\quad d_{i+1}d_i d_{i+1}=d_{i+1}\\ (1\\le i\\le n-2),\\qquad d_i d_j=d_jd_i\\ (1\\le i,j<n,\\ |i-j|>1).$$\n\nConsequently the assignment $u_i\\mapsto d_i$ extends to a unital $R$-algebra homomorphism\n\n$$\\pi_n:P_n(R,\\delta)\\longrightarrow\\mathrm{TL}_n(R,\\delta).$$",
