          "source": "thm-alexanders-closed-braid-theorem",
          "source_section": "Statement",
          "quote": "Assume the Axiom of Choice. Every oriented link $L\\subset\\mathbb R^3\\subset S^3$\nis equivalent to the oriented closure $\\widehat\\beta$ of a geometric braid\n$\\beta$ on some number $n\\ge0$ of strands, with $n\\ge1$ when $L$ is nonempty.",
