        },
        {
          "fact": "F2",
          "source": "lem-singular-earring-instanton-homology-of-the-unknot-is-integrally-rank-one",
          "source_section": "Statement",
          "quote": "Assume full AC. For the smooth based unknot $U\\subset S^3$, the integral singular earring instanton group is isomorphic to $\\mathbb Z$, and its rationalization has dimension one. There are regular choices with one critical generator and zero differential. Its generator is specified only up to the usual orientation sign; no distinguished sign-independent canonical class or sutured-excision identification is asserted.",
