ity is exactly that of $f,g$. In the transverse case this number is $\\#(X\\times_MZ)\\bmod2$. Homotopies of either or both maps give product homotopies, hence this number is invariant by the fixed-submanifold homotopy theorem. The arbitrary-map extension is under $\\mathrm{AC}_\\omega$ as above.",
