          "source_section": "Definition",
          "quote": "For a compact operator $K:X\\to Y$ between real or complex Hilbert spaces over the same scalar field, write $N(K):=\\{x\\in X:Kx=0\\}$. For a set $M$ with $0\\in M\\subseteq N(K)^\\perp$ and $\\delta\\ge0$, define $\\varepsilon_K(M,\\delta):=\\sup\\{\\|x\\|_X:x\\in M,\\ \\|Kx\\|_Y\\le\\delta\\}\\in[0,+\\infty]$.",
          "uses": [
